WHAT CHANGED
- memorian-judge-run.ts: deadline in either race phase still abortAndDispose + warns
  "memorian gate deadline exceeded" with { runId, salvaged: accepted.length }.
  If accepted.length > 0 return { status: "completed", partial: true } WITHOUT setting
  state.cancelled (so launchOnce does not drop salvage as cancelled). Else keep
  { status: "failed", cause: "deadline", ... } including setup-path state.cancelled = true.
