  launchOnce treats completed+partial like any completed judge: validateNudges, then the
  existing cancelled / compaction-staleness drops, then { status: "nudged", ..., partial: true }.
- memorian-trigger.ts: tool_call origin deadlineMs 45_000 -> 90_000 (settled path unchanged).
- tests: salvage / empty-deadline / compaction-on-deadline in memorian-runner-completion.test.ts;
  trigger pin 90_000.

